# The repository's .gitignore is for .NET projects; Unity keeps .meta files and Packages/manifest.json.
!*.meta
!/Packages/*

/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.slnx

# Restored by NuGetForUnity from Assets/packages.config when the project opens
/Assets/Packages/
/Assets/Packages.meta
